     bbnnxxtt — Broadcom NetXtreme-C/E 10Gb/25Gb/40Gb/50Gb Ethernet device

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     bbnnxxtt** aatt ppccii??

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The bbnnxxtt driver supports the Broadcom NetXtreme-C/E PCI Express Ethernet
     adapters based on the Broadcom BCM573xx and BCM574xx chipsets, including
     the following:

           ••   Broadcom P150c Adapter (10/25/40/50Gb QSFP28)
           ••   Broadcom P150p Adapter (10/25/40/50Gb QSFP28)
           ••   Broadcom P210c Adapter (10Gb SFP+)
           ••   Broadcom P210p Adapter (10Gb SFP+)
           ••   Broadcom P210tp Adapter (10GBASE-T)
           ••   Broadcom P225c Adapter (10/25Gb QSFP28)
           ••   Broadcom P225p Adapter (10/25Gb SFP28)

     Adapters based on these chipsets are also available as LOM/Mezzanine op‐
     tions for Dell, Lenovo, HPE and Supermicro servers.

